1
00:05:48,750 --> 00:05:54,750
Monster Family is a animation, family, fantasy film directed by Holger Tappe.

2
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:43,500
The Wishbone family are far from happy.

3
00:17:26,250 --> 00:17:32,250
In an attempt to reconnect as a family, they plan a fun night out.

4
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:21,000
However, the plan backfires when they are cursed and all turned into Monsters.

5
00:29:03,750 --> 00:29:09,750
Emma Wishbone (voice), played by Emily Watson.

6
00:34:52,500 --> 00:34:58,500
Frank Wishbone (voice), played by Nick Frost.

7
00:40:41,250 --> 00:40:47,250
Fay Wishbone (voice), played by Jessica Brown Findlay.

8
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:36,000
Max Wishbone (voice), played by Ethan Rouse.

9
00:52:18,750 --> 00:52:24,750
Dracula (voice), played by Jason Isaacs.

10
00:58:07,500 --> 00:58:13,500
Baba Yaga (voice), played by Catherine Tate.

11
01:03:56,250 --> 01:04:02,250
Monster Family (also known as Happy Family in Germany) is a 2017 animated monster comedy film directed by Holger
Tappe, and written by David Safier and Catharina Junk, based on Safier's 2011 novel Happy Family.

12
01:09:45,000 --> 01:09:51,000
The film stars Emily Watson, Nick Frost, Jessica Brown Findlay,
Celia Imrie, Catherine Tate, and Jason Isaacs.

13
01:15:33,750 --> 01:15:39,750
The film received generally negative reviews from critics, and was a
commercial failure, grossing $26 million against a $30 million budget.

14
01:21:22,500 --> 01:21:28,500
A sequel titled Monster Family 2 was released in 2021.

15
01:27:11,250 --> 01:27:17,250
The tone is lighthearted.
